## Installation

The package targets .NET Standard 2.0 and .NET Framework 4.6.2, so it runs on .NET 5 or later, .NET Core 2.0 or later, and .NET Framework 4.6.2 or later.

Install it with the .NET CLI:

```bash
dotnet add package {{ spec.info.title | caseUcfirst }} --version {{ sdk.version }}
```

Or with the Package Manager Console:

```powershell
Install-Package {{ spec.info.title | caseUcfirst }} -Version {{ sdk.version }}
```

Or add a reference to your project's `.csproj` file:

```xml
<PackageReference Include="{{ spec.info.title | caseUcfirst }}" Version="{{ sdk.version }}" />
```
